* Edit 2: Replace common-gate with common-source and add inductive gate matching
* Adds gate inductor (L3) and bypass capacitor (Cbyp2) for input matching
L L3 VIN1 n1
C Cbyp2 n1 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
L L2 n2 VDD
C C2 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n1
C C1 VIN1 n0  ; (redundant, but preserves VIN1 connectivity)